# Flatzz documentation

Use the Flatzz compiler to generate Zig types and operations from FlatBuffers
schemas. The runtime serializes values and borrows views of their backing bytes.

~~~=html
<p>Browse the <a href="../examples/">official examples</a> to see complete Zig projects.</p>
